<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53691" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταβῐ-όω</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεβίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					355a
				</span></i>
			, later 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεβίωσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					12.28.6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				24
			</span></i>:—<i>pass one's life</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἡδέως καταβιῶναι τὸν βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
				</span></i>
			 l. c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				578c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.627
			</span></i>: c. part., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ξενιτεύων,
				σοφιστεύων</span>, Plb.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
			</span></i> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. διώξαντες ἕτερον ἢ καὶ φυγόντες
					ὑφ᾽ ἑτέρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.166
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. γεωργοῦντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					13.4.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bring one's life to an end, die</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγεται ἄρτιος καταβιῶναι καὶ τὰς
					αἰσθήσεις ἡβῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					1.9.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
